      "say": "Why borrow Homer? On the left, the Greek epic: kings, a war over Helen, gods. On the right, Walcott's version: two fishermen who quarrel over Helen, on an island that Britain and France fought over again and again, an island nicknamed the Helen of the West Indies. Walcott says ordinary Caribbean lives deserve epic. Do you agree?",
